          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Return-block.jpg",
            "image_alt": "RETURN",
            "text_alignment": "center",
            "title": "RETURN",
            "description": "<p>Using the return label provided, package all four rings and drop off at your nearest USPS office by the Day 7 of your trial. Now, you can shop and build your dream ring with online Ring Builder. We will craft it for you in 10–15 business days and ship it.<\/p>",
